      "id": 222944,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-10-16T21:38:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yep, even Amazon, usually the late bloomer.&nbsp; Just played my first game.&nbsp; Fixed Point has some interesting interactions with several of these guys, and oddly, most of them bad.&nbsp; Fixed Point + From the Brink or Regeneration&nbsp;is pretty sweet.&nbsp; Fixed Point + Bored Now is bugged (report submitted).&nbsp; Also Regeneration in Vengeance mode is ridiculous.&nbsp; Went from Mainstay at 1 and everyone else at 5 or less to Mainstay at 4 and Medico in the high teens.&nbsp; I had everyone beaten but Greazer, who wasn't even hurt, and figured I'd just win when Mainstay went down.&nbsp; Then Mainstay didn't go down and Greazer got karate chopped for 18.&nbsp; Weird team, weird game.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:55:59.038Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
