      "id": 222945,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-10-16T22:30:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I discovered a wonderful interaction today while trying out digital Void Guard.</p>\n<p>Give Writhe Twist the Ether.</p>\n<p>When he uses the power that lets him do extra damage, but sacrifices the Shadow Cloak, just change it all to melee. Or cold. Or whatever. It only checks to see what type of damage has been dealt, not how many instances of damage, and between TTE and the Cloak itself, that's base 9 damage to one target! :D</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:55:59.109Z",
