      "cooked": "<p>Considering they currently ignore 'The' and 'La' when sorting names alphabetically, I'm sure it wouldn't be super hard to add \"Void Guard\" to that list&nbsp;and still preserve their names as 'Void Guard &lt;X&gt;' for purposes like logs.</p>\n<p>Or at least give the option somewhere, so Christopher can do whatever the heck he wants and the rest of us can be right. :V</p>",
