      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/e8c25b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-10-17T17:03:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>One weird thing about the Void Guard being individual heroes rather than a Sentinels variant is that you can play a team with the Sentinels and all of the Void Guard Sentinels. I’m not sure how you rationalize that.</p>\n<p>Also, I discovered in a test game that they’re all Nemesis-es (Nemesi?) to each other, which makes Vaccination much less attractive when Dr. Medico is playing with his teammates.</p>",
